I am standing in my kitchen.
I am hungry.
I open the cupboard.
The cupboard is almost empty.
I have no bread.
I see no coffee either.
Then I open the fridge.
The fridge is empty too.
I have no cheese.
I have absolutely no fresh food.
That is not good.
I want to cook at the weekend.
I need a lot of groceries for the week.
I sit at the table now.
I take a pen.
I write a shopping list.
I note down bread, coffee and apples.
I like cheese a lot.
So I write the cheese on the list too.
Now I am ready for the supermarket.
